silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_18_presheaf_semantics_concrete_anchor_1_DomesticCat silm:hasExample "In 'S02BridgeTo18PresheafSemanticsConcreteAnchor1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the classification leg label; a typed class object distinct from Mittens; receives only the type leg, not the body-mass/microchip/care-process legs." .
